  SpeakerName: Jamie Olive Oil
  DialogueText: "\u201COh\u2026 oh my. Contestant\u2026 this is marvelous!\nThe crust\u2014perfectly
    golden, beautifully crisp. The interior\u2014juicy, tender, seasoned with surprising
    confidence. This isn\u2019t just a cooked dish\u2026 this is artistry!\nYou\u2019ve
    balanced texture and flavor with the skill of a seasoned chef. I must say, I
    am thoroughly impressed. If this is the level of talent you bring to the kitchen,
    the audience may need to brace themselves for a culinary revolution.\u201D"
